  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.31\n\n## Changes since v0.1.24\n\n- Allow large Fleet package and artifact uploads (`65d39aa`)\n- fix: retry NuGet indexing without occupying workers (#37) (`5d728f5`)\n- Keep pinned release checkout on a named branch (#36) (`2b9da80`)\n- Show readable labels for Fleet release phases (#34) (`494e1f6`)\n- Make multi-package NuGet releases resumable and verifiable (#33) (`454349e`)\n- Enable staged NuGet and GitHub release publishing (#32) (`189ccec`)\n- Release jobs: immutable SHA, fail-closed gates and exact package inventory (#31) (`b0fc89a`)\n",
